Director of Financial Risk &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we&#39;re building the leading financial platform for small businesses. As we continue to grow across multiple markets, strong financial risk management is essential to helping us scale safely, responsibly and sustainably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Director of Financial Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead our global 2LOD Financial Risk team and shape how we identify, assess and oversee financial risks across the business. You&#39;ll own our financial risk framework while providing independent oversight, challenge and trusted advice to 1LOD teams across:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Reporting &amp;amp; Control (statutory &amp;amp; regulatory accounting),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FP&amp;amp;A (management accounting &amp;amp; commercial finance),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance Operations (including account operations, reconciliations, AP &amp;amp; AR, payroll)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treasury&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance Product (systems support for Finance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Development (for any CorDev working impacting FinRisk)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As well as the Regional Heads/Directors of Finance that coordinate these functions for their region (UK, EU, India).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible leadership role, and you’ll be at the forefront of scaling in new markets, working on new licences, and new products. We are looking for not just a deep subject matter expert, but a trusted leader to help us scale whilst managing our financial risks.&amp;nbsp; You will need to be a strong collaborator, as you&#39;ll work closely with a variety of stakeholders, from senior leadership and executives to auditors and banking partners, to ensure Tide remains financially resilient while continuing to innovate for our members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BE DOING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global role in which you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve Tide&#39;s Financial Risk Management Framework, ensuring it grows with the business as we expand into new markets, launch new products and operate under new licences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide independent oversight and challenge of 1LOD activities relating to financial risks, working mostly with Finance and Treasury. You need to be deeply familiar with how a global Treasury function works, to be able to identify and manage risks arising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of financial risk governance across all regulated entities and jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and enhance financial risk appetite metrics, limits, triggers, and escalation protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear and independent reporting to Group and entity-level Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Committees and Boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor capital adequacy, liquidity, concentration risks, and financial resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory engagements, audits, thematic reviews, and licence applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently oversee treasury and liquidity management activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and challenge liquidity forecasting methodologies and stress assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain existing risk policies and frameworks, and develop new ones as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead financial risk assessments for new products, partnerships, and market launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other Risk &amp;amp; Compliance teams, various Finance teams, Legal and Internal Audit teams to ensure integrated risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present concise and insightful risk reporting to Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Committees, and lead on the Financial Risk Working Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a high-performing and experienced global financial risk team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who combines deep technical expertise with excellent judgement and the ability to influence across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll likely have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading Financial Risk within fintech, payments, e-money, banking or another regulated financial services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a 2LOD leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of financial risk frameworks within payment institutions, e-money institutions or digital banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across treasury, liquidity, solvability, capital, solvency, statutory reporting and tax risk.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accounting expertise; ideally with an accounting qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple regulatory jurisdictions and engaging directly with regulators and auditors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance strong risk management with commercial ambition in a fast-moving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the confidence to influence senior stakeholders and provide independent challenge when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style, with experience building and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;ll enjoy working in a fast-paced environment, be comfortable navigating change, and care about helping Tide build a resilient business that continues to deliver for our members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation -&amp;nbsp; competitive salary and share options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Paid maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to salary sacrifice benefits – like Nursery (could save up to 47% on fees!) and Cycle to Work discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Comprehensive Private family insurance plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Cover – Comprehensive accidental and life insurance protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Build your retirement fund faster with Tide’s pension scheme on eligible earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; Meals – Daily breakfast spread with all-day coffee, tea, and juices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Enablement

Analytics Engineer – BI Platform &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From real-time logistics to resilient infrastructure and marketplace optimisation, we design, build and operate technology that powers Deliveroo’s growth at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;BI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. This role is based in our London office with a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; setup, typically 3 days in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/software-engineering-at-deliveroo/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Engineering&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Core BI team builds and operates the services, integrations and automation that power business intelligence across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt. Our platforms help analysts, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers and business teams discover trusted data and make informed decisions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine software engineering, platform ownership, and a strong user focus to make BI tooling reliable, secure, scalable and self-service. The team supports the current BI ecosystem while helping shape a more integrated experience across the DoorDash group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a BI Engineer on the Core BI team, you will build and operate the models, systems and automation behind our BI platforms. This will include supporting our extensive user base on our current BI stack (primarily Looker and Sigma) while helping shape a single, more integrated BI platform across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own problems from discovery through design, implementation, deployment, and operational support. You will work closely with Data Engineers, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers, Product Managers and business teams to turn recurring user needs into durable, self-service capabilities. If you&#39;re energized by solving technical problems with data and comfortable being deeply embedded across several domains, this role is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and evolve the semantic layer behind our BI platforms: LookML and Canvas BI models, metric and dimension definitions, and the governance that keeps them trusted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and operate the Looker and Sigma platforms themselves: instance and workspace configuration, permissions and user attributes, content lifecycle, and API-driven automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the development of self-serve tooling that removes manual BI administration, using usage analytics to decide what to automate, build or retire next&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support BI platform migrations and deprecations across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt while protecting access, governance, data integrity and business continuity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take part in operational support, production debugging and incident response for the BI stack, and fix the root causes you find&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Champion engineering standards in BI, including version control, code review, CI and testing for models and platform code, so changes ship safely and repeatably&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience in business intelligence engineering, analytics engineering, data engineering, or a similar code-first data role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong Python and SQL skills, and hands-on experience using AI tools (LLMs, agentic workflows, AI-assisted development) to accelerate your own engineering work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience building in a BI platform such as Looker (LookML) or Sigma, modelling and configuring it, not only building dashboards in it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with semantic or metrics layers (LookML, dbt or similar): defining metrics and dimensions, and keeping those definitions consistent as they are reused&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience running what you build in production: version control, code review, CI, debugging live issues and taking part in operational support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills, and comfortable self-organising in a fast-paced, distributed environment with both technical and non-technical teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with modern data warehousing platforms (e.g., Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift) and ability to optimize performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience automating BI administration through platform APIs, or identity and access through Okta, SCIM or role-based access controls&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting a BI stack across multiple brands, tenants or regions, or leading a BI platform migration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering (Data Platform)  London

Senior Consultant/Manager, Platforms (Front Office Transformation) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26581093 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26581093 BCX8&quot;&gt;Front Office Transformation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;practice are looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;experienced consultants to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;Digital &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt; team are hiring highly motivated and talented individuals to help our clients shape and delivery their &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;Front Office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt; Transformation using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;platforms such as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;Salesforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;, ServiceNow, Dynamics and Braze.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;  Our team are passionate about helping clients define and realise the outcomes that will transform their business from a strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;proposition, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;procurement, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;commercial, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt;cultural&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot;&gt; and organisational perspective. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW65818792 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be joining our small but perfectly formed practice who are passionate about how platform technology can accelerate our clients modernisation and transformation agenda. You will be involved in helping clients understand what makes their customers tick by:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;26&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Shape Front Office transformation strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; by helping clients understand customer, colleague and stakeholder needs, defining growth ambitions and translating these into customer, CRM, AI, sales, service and marketing strategies enabled by Salesforce, ServiceNow and adjacent technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
