&lt;li&gt;Strong academic record and excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills and experience developing or fine-tuning AI/ML models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with computer vision, VLMs, image understanding, or related ML applications.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
