&lt;li&gt;Design evaluation frameworks covering model quality, latency, reliability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take models from experimentation into production, including packaging, deployment, monitoring, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize inference performance and operational cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Research and Product teams to turn prototypes and experiments into scalable product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to modern ML infrastructure and MLOps while remaining hands-on with models and model behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
