&lt;li&gt;Experience with inference engines like vLLM or SGLang, and platforms like NVIDIA Triton or Ollama.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with fine-tuning, prompting, model evaluation, inference, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working understanding of AI model encoding and quantization formats, and the tradeoffs thereof.&lt;/li&gt;
